{"product":{"id":7413058502699,"title":"Classic American White Sturgeon Caviar","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eNative to California, this caviar comes from the largest freshwater fish in North America, the Pacific White Sturgeon. This farm-raised sturgeon is highly regarded for the sustainable caviar it produces, with brown to black hues and generously sized pearls. The flavor is clean and fresh on the palate, complemented by a creamy, lingering finish.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eCharacterized by medium-sized grains, ranging in color from dark gray to light brown, American White Sturgeon caviar is consistently fresh, of exceptional quality, and especially appreciated for its clean, creamy, and delicate flavor. Raised in Sacramento, California, and adhering to all international health, animal welfare, and environmental regulations, this is a truly spectacular All-American sturgeon caviar. We are pleased to offer it as a sustainable alternative to wild-caught products. Compare it to our other grade, \u003ca href=\"\/royal-california-white-sturgeon-caviar\/\"\u003eRoyal White Sturgeon\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"editable-text\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"\u003eEach jar is hand-packed and carefully inspected for optimal color, size, freshness, flavor, and texture. For additional details on shipping, usage, and privacy policies, please visit our Policy Page \u003ca href=\"\/pages\/policies\"\u003ePolicy Page.\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Caviar Star","product_type":"physical","created_at":"2025-07-11T03:51:42-04:00","handle":"classic-california-white-sturgeon-caviar","updated_at":"2026-10-06T06:18:38-04:00","published_at":"2026-03-30T19:11:45-04:00","template_suffix":"caviar-variants","published_scope":"global","tags":"America, American Caviar, By_Country, California Caviar, California Stur